{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All edge cases work correctly:\n1. Without `--max-pending-hours`: pending proofs are accepted (exit 0)\n2. With `--max-pending-hours H`: pending proofs older than H hours cause exit 1 with message \"still pending N h\"\n3. Pending proofs younger than H hours are accepted (exit 0)\n4. Confirmed proofs are always accepted regardless of age\n5. Missing OTS proofs are still caught as before\n6. All existing tests pass\n\nThe implementation is complete and correct. Let me run the tests one more time to be absolutely sure.","thinkingSignature":"[{\"type\":\"reasoning.text\",\"text\":\"All edge cases work correctly:\\n1. Without `--max-pending-hours`: pending proofs are accepted (exit 0)\\n2. With `--max-pending-hours H`: pending proofs older than H hours cause exit 1 with message \\\"still pending N h\\\"\\n3. Pending proofs younger than H hours are accepted (exit 0)\\n4. Confirmed proofs are always accepted regardless of age\\n5. Missing OTS proofs are still caught as before\\n6. All existing tests pass\\n\\nThe implementation is complete and correct. Let me run the tests one more time to be absolutely sure.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]"},{"type":"text","text":"All edge cases work correctly. Let me run the full test suite one final time:\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-7a39b650-3407-4b6e-accc-edacf158b334","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/record && python3 -m unittest test_record"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free","usage":{"input":3546,"output":173,"cacheRead":35072,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":120,"totalTokens":38791,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0,"totalFromProvider":true}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1794740094073,"responseId":"gen-1794740094-Ym2EVy0Fp61YUSeJNhQ2","rawStopReason":"tool_calls","durationMs":3720,"thinkingLevel":"medium"},"too